✅ 4. Comparison: join() vs sleep()

| Feature                       | `join()`                          | `sleep()`                                 |
| ----------------------------- | --------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------- |
| Purpose                       | Wait for another thread to finish | Pause the current thread for a fixed time |
| Wait Depends On               | Another thread's completion       | Time duration                             |
| Releases Monitor Lock         | ❌ No                             | ❌ No                                     |
| Throws `InterruptedException` | ✅ Yes                            | ✅ Yes                                    |
| Common Use                    | Thread coordination               | Delay execution                           |
